    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it isnt just a \"mistake\" though. i actually caused real damage. i see it every day. people used to trust me and now they look at me with this... disgust. i can't just \"take small steps\" and pretend it didn't happen. it's like i've become this monster and there's no way to un-become it. i don't think there's any version of my life where i'm not this person.",
